227	 * and (for billing templates) attach the invoice. Thin convenience over
228	 * `sendMail` for new callers.
229	 *
230	 * `kind` is forwarded to `sendMail`, which is the ONLY place the notification
231	 * policy is enforced. It used to be absent from this signature, so every send
232	 * routed through this wrapper was structurally incapable of honouring the
233	 * customer's "Account email" preference — a caller could not have opted in even
